  "name": "Mind Blast (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, a psychic can emit a blast of psychokinetic energy with the power of her mind. As a standard action, the psychic can make a ranged touch attack at a creature within 30 ft. that deals 1d6 points of non-elemental damage + her Intelligence modifier to the creature struck. At 6th level and every three psychic levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6 (2d6 at 6th, 3d6 at 9th, 4d6 at 12th, 5d6 at 15th, 6d6 at 18th).</p>",
